      "side": 1,
      "message": "I recognize the basic order of operations isn\u0027t being changed, but it\u0027s not clear to me why setting the notification enable register is done prior to PPM_RESET. If PPM_RESET is supposed to reset all of the UCSI registers to their default state, does that not include the notification enable register?",
