      "side": 1,
      "message": "Adding some additional context. Section 6.3 of the V3.0 of the UCSI spec details an example PPM reset flow. In this example flow, the PPM reset is listed as an optional step 1 and step 2 is to enable \u0027Command_Completed` notification bit. But, here the notifcation_enable step is preceding the PPM reset step.",
